gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Yo, buddy, you awake? You've been\n"
	.string "out cold for a couple days now;\p"
	.string "Ever since you washed up on the shore\n"
	.string "here in DEWFORD. How do you feel?\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "Shoot... yeah, here, I'll give you\n"
	.string "something for your headache. Better?\p"
	.string "...\n"
	.string "Well, anyways, your boat was smashed-\l"
	.string "up on the shore. No salvaging that\l"
	.string "pile of planks.\p"
	.string "You can stay here at the ADMIRAL BENBOW\n"
	.string "INN until you find a way to get on your\l"
	.string "feet, a'ight? I paid your room for ya.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "BRAWLY: Oh, by the way, I'm BRAWLY!\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "SYSTEM: Which character would you like\n"
	.string "to play as? Don't worry; you'll have a\l"
	.string "chance to change your name, if you want.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "SYSTEM: Enter your name. Or, leave the\n"
	.string "field blank to keep the default name.$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "BRAWLY: Righteous name.\n"
	.string "Well, {PLAYER}{KUN}, I've gotta run some\l"
	.string "errands, but we'll keep in-touch.\p"
	.string "In the meantime, why don't you talk to\n"
	.string "people around town and see if they can\l"
	.string "help with your predicament?\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "BRAWLY: The world's dangerous out there,\n"
	.string "so be careful, yeah? I'll be taking my\l"
	.string "leave now. Ja na!\p"
	.string "$"
